            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Etkin düşmanlar dizisine <code>\"Goblin\"</code> ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeEnemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeEnemies.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeEnemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>activeEnemies</code>, ardından <code>.push(\"Goblin\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147928,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.push(\"Shield\")</code> kodunu yazarak dizinin sonuna <code>\"Shield\"</code> ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"49\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"loot.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(loot);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>.push(\"Shield\")</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
