            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizinin sonuna önce <code>2</code>, ardından <code>500</code> ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreEvents = [\" /><text value=\"-100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreEvents.push(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scoreEvents);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(</code>, ardından <code>2</code> ve sonra <code>500</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
