            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.pop()</code> kodunu kullanarak dizinin sonundaki <code>true</code> değerini kaldır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"63\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorsUnlocked = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"doorsUnlocked.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(doorsUnlocked);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>.pop()</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
